    "sentence_translations": [
      "Diary of a Small Flower",
      "",
      "Today is Sunday, May 10th.",
      "",
      "Last week, my teacher told us that the second Sunday in May is Mother’s Day, which is a festival for mothers.",
      "So today I went to the flower shop. I wanted to buy flowers for Mom.",
      "",
      "There were so many people in the flower shop! I asked the shop owner, “Boss, how much are carnations?”",
      "The shop owner said: “I’m sorry, child. We have sold out of carnations.” I was very sad and didn’t know what to do.",
      "At that time, the shop owner looked at me, gave me two paintbrushes and a piece of paper, and said, ..",
      ".. “You can paint carnations for your mom. She will also be very happy.”",
      "",
      "After I got home, I showed Mom my painting. Mom really was very happy!",
      "She hugged me and said, “Thank you. This is the best present.” I hope that Mom can be this happy every day."
    ]
  }
